{"formula":"sum of four token buckets in the half-open window","formula_version":"acceptance-r1-a1","from":"2026-10-15T00:00:00Z","inputs":{"activity":[],"activity_events":[],"demand_events":[],"destination_snapshots":[],"handoff_members":[],"intakes":[],"k2_closed_item":"Closed item: a queue item whose destination is this seat, counted once, with at least one successful terminal transition inside the half-open window [from, to): state done (closure reason no-follow-on, handed_off_to, escalation, or none) or state handed-off. Excluded: canceled, denied, failed, blocked, unknown or unlisted states, and done with closure reason denied or canceled. Tokens per closed item = seat tokens in the window / closed items; zero closed items = no data.","k2_closed_items_with_insufficient_history":0,"k2_destination_rule":"K5: destination at the closing transition = the latest queue.created destinationSession or qitem.fallback_routed rerouteDestination at or before it. The current queue_items.destination_session (snapshot cutoff queue_items.ts_updated) is used only when the item's queue.created is in the event history and there is no reroute mark (fallback-routed: transition note, qitem.fallback_routed event, fallback-from: chain_of_record entry, or differing stored snapshots). A reroute mark without a reroute event, or a creation outside the history, is insufficient history: the item counts for no seat and is listed under closed items with insufficient history.","k2_insufficient_history_members":[],"m1_by_seat":[],"m1_yield":null,"m2_pairs":[],"m2_return_rate":null,"m3_chains":0,"m3_rework_chains":0,"m3_rework_members":[],"m3_rework_proportion":"no data","m3_unknown_chains":0,"m3_unknown_members":[],"mission_ambiguous_by_reason":{},"mission_by_seat":[],"mission_definition":"Mission attribution (K3/K5): a usage record gets the mission of the items its seat has in progress at that instant. An item is the seat's when its K5 destination then is the seat; the actor is never the destination. Missions are the item's mission: tags as set at creation. Every applicable ambiguity reason is recorded; the primary reason is the first that applies in this fixed order: insufficient history > detectable tag change > conflicting missions. Only the primary reason is counted in the ambiguous shares, so the shares sum exactly to the ambiguous band; secondary reasons are evidence only and overlap.","mission_records":[],"mission_tokens":{},"nonreturn_handoffs":[],"openrig_sources":[{"bytes":12288,"path":"/home/sam/code/dendro/goals/tool-loop-source-trace/baseline-probe/sources/openrig.sqlite","revision":"3298c538bb447c139010e664399e5c01ce6fa64f4a68c732c6151dbf5336c002","source_id":"openrig\n/home/sam/code/dendro/goals/tool-loop-source-trace/baseline-probe/sources/openrig.sqlite\n"}],"pair_medians":[],"reasoning_rule":"reasoning is part of output, shown separately and never added again; claude does not record it","rows":[],"seat_lives":[],"seat_token_categories":[],"sessions":[{"cache_read":0,"cache_write":0,"discovered_by":["identity","zero-usage file"],"harness":"codex","input_uncached":0,"output":0,"period_records":0,"reasoning":0,"rig":"probe-rig","seat":"synthetic-seat","session":"synthetic-33-session","status":"linked","tokens":0,"untimestamped":{"records":0,"scope":"session only, outside every period figure","tokens":0}}],"token_categories":{"cache_read":0,"cache_write":0,"input_uncached":0,"output":0,"reasoning":"not recorded","tokens":0},"tokens":0,"unlinked_token_categories":{"collision":{"cache_read":0,"cache_write":0,"input_uncached":0,"output":0,"reasoning":"not recorded","tokens":0},"unlinked":{"cache_read":0,"cache_write":0,"input_uncached":0,"output":0,"reasoning":"not recorded","tokens":0}},"unlinked_tokens":0,"untimestamped_count":0,"untimestamped_tokens_all_time":0,"window":{"from":"2026-10-15T00:00:00Z","to":"2026-10-15T00:30:00Z"}},"metric_id":"tokens","rig":"probe-rig","to":"2026-10-15T00:30:00Z","value":0}
